      "mergeID": "60f475280e0d835bca124485",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Some value inputs on specific nodes (examples: Vector2, Vector3, Vector4, Set position, and probably others I haven't found) seem to be overflowing beyond the edges of the node. In the nodes mentioned, it prevents you from changing anything but the X component of the vector. \nThis issue also happens to any operators of the mentioned nodes. Creating an operator node out weirdly creates a noodle that is disconnected/offset from the node itself, as well.\nExample video + repro:\nhttps://streamable.com/1xds40\n(Possibly related to Orels' canny about PlayerApi.GetTrackingData not having an output due to 2019 styling)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.07.15.13.46] (GUI) Some nodes + noodles don't behave as expected",
